      zh: `孟子曰：「欲貴者，人之同心也。人人有貴於己者，弗思耳矣。人之所貴者，非良貴也。趙孟之所貴，趙孟能賤之。《詩》云：『既醉以酒，既飽以德。』言飽乎仁義也，所以不願人之膏粱之味也。令聞廣譽施於身，所以不願人之文繡也。」`,
      en: `Mencius said, "Wanting honor is the same mind in all people. Everyone has something honorable in themselves — only they do not reflect on it. What people honor is not the true honor. What Zhao Meng honors, Zhao Meng can make base. The Odes say, 'Already drunk with wine, already filled with virtue' — meaning filled with humaneness and righteousness, so one does not envy others' rich tastes. When fair fame and wide reputation rest on one's person, one does not envy others' embroidered robes."`
